#!golden 1
#!case cmd_raw
#!section exit
1
#!section stdout
#!section stderr
Not enough parameters given.
RAW Commands:  raw <netfn> <cmd> [data]

Network Function Codes:

  VAL\tHEX\tSTRING
==============================================
  0\t0x00\tChassis
  2\t0x02\tBridge
  4\t0x04\tSensorEvent
  6\t0x06\tApplication
  8\t0x08\tFirmware
  10\t0x0a\tStorage
  12\t0x0c\tTransport

(can also use raw hex values)
